sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API Lambda
  participant P as Postgres, pgmq agent_step
  participant R as Runner, jadwigo_runner role
  participant M as Meta Muse, /v1/responses
  W->>A: a message, photos attached
  A->>P: 1 transaction: run, step
  A-->>W: 201, the run
  A-)R: async invoke, 0 retries
  R->>P: read the step
  R->>M: prompt and verbs
  M-->>R: verb calls, then words
  R->>P: run events, fenced
  R->>P: archive the step
  W->>A: poll the conversation
  A-->>W: events, folded
